                                                "sense_id": "c6cf34fd-8798-3c7a-805d-f4e0a74b50fc",
                                                "text": "He's only 16 months, but is already a good counter – he can count to 100."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e614520c-602f-3729-97e5-4624831b31d3",
                                        "entry_id": "ea89b9d4-9dcf-32cf-a155-3340128d052e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A reckoner; someone who collects data by counting; an enumerator."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "910d6025-102b-4e0f-861e-1095173b3ac9",
                                                "sense_id": "e614520c-602f-3729-97e5-4624831b31d3",
                                                "text": "The basic idea is that the researcher conducting the transect (called the counter or enumerator) walks along a set path at certain intervals (hourly, daily, monthly, etc.) and tallies all instances of whatever is being surveyed."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b72cff4e-86a4-3a4e-be55-e1531bb3d367",
                                        "entry_id": "ea89b9d4-9dcf-32cf-a155-3340128d052e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An object (now especially a small disc) used in counting or keeping count, or as a marker in games, etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "04173e06-4ace-43e2-a9c2-b4365e189052",
                                                "sense_id": "b72cff4e-86a4-3a4e-be55-e1531bb3d367",
                                                "text": "He rolled a six on the dice, so moved his counter forward six spaces."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5a55922c-3e7b-3bc5-84b5-6937f3f9eb72",
                                        "entry_id": "ea89b9d4-9dcf-32cf-a155-3340128d052e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A telltale; a contrivance attached to an engine, printing press, or other machine, for the purpose of counting the revolutions or the pulsations."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "58327301-ae7e-357a-88f4-92a7e4e58bb1",
                                        "entry_id": "ea89b9d4-9dcf-32cf-a155-3340128d052e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A variable, memory location, etc. whose contents are incremented to keep a count."
