                                                "example_id": "e6c81e18-3f81-43ef-bf43-0c5f193b0653",
                                                "sense_id": "8acbf12a-88c2-3a8a-980e-8c9ca09fd771",
                                                "text": "Seymour, sitting in an old corduroy armchair across the room, a cigarette going, wearing a blue shirt, gray slacks, moccasins with the counters broken down, a shaving cut on the side of his face […]"
