                                                "sense_id": "bef48ec6-824c-3343-9a4f-f7956c5efa2d",
                                                "text": "Entirely filled with the image of another, her heart, indeed, had the deaf ear of the adder, which heedeth not the voice of the charmer, charm he never so wisely."
